port security/lxqt-sudo
type port
reason "define FreeBSD's C-locale password prompt on DragonFly too"
target @any

# files/patch-sudo.cpp defines it for __FreeBSD__ only but uses it everywhere.
text replace-once file files/patch-sudo.cpp from "+#ifdef __FreeBSD__" to "+#if defined(__FreeBSD__) || defined(__DragonFly__)"
